# Secrets the Worker needs. The Deploy to Cloudflare button prompts for each.
# A long random passphrase you type on the connector's approval page,
# e.g. the output of `openssl rand -base64 24`. 20 characters minimum.
OWNER_PASSPHRASE=
# The CDP API key JSON file Coinbase gave you, on one line (ECDSA key).
CBASE_CDP_KEY=
